  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOLDOVA HIV - Moldova (01-Jan-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moldova, HIV, Center for Health Policies and Studies (PAS Center)This program has the following goals: To reduce HIV prevalence among key affected populations and AIDS related mortaility in the Republic of Moldova. The objectives of this program are: To ensure universal access to comprehensive HIV treatment, care and support.  To increase access to evidence-based HIV prevention.  To strengthen communities capacity and ensure program sustainability</narrative>
  </description>
